// # Propulsion Hardware Valve & CFD Stubs
//
// Logline: Provides fail-closed security stubs for combustion instability CFD and hardware valve actuators.
//
// Setup: Requires SysCap capability; fails closed on unsupported native propulsion FFI.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Guard high-fidelity combustion instability CFD solver invocations.
//   2. Guard hardware servo valve actuator PWM and analog telemetry streams.
//   3. Enforce fail-closed termination for unverified engine controller routines.

import "./propulsion_engine.oo";

// Tiny marker so importers do not see pure-stub-only unit.
pub fn propulsion_module_ready() -> Bool {
    return true;
}

// -------------------------------------------------------------------
// 9. Fail-Closed Stubs for Compiler Limitations (process_exit(1))
